      "content": "Reviewing the last three weeks of logs is necessary to establish if this is a persistent trend or an isolated event. If the uptick is a consistent, measurable progression across multiple flights, it indicates a developing mechanical issue requiring inspection before departure. However, if the vibration spike correlates only with specific atmospheric conditions or has no clear pattern, it might be attributable to sensor noise or thermal variance.",
